&lt;tr style="height:24.5pt;min-height:24.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#c6d9f0;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;施策方針&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#c6d9f0;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;指標/目標（2024年３月期実績）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#c6d9f0;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;取り組み内容（2024年３月期実績）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:107.3pt;min-height:107.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;失敗を恐れず、誰もが挑戦できる組織風土&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆メンバーシップサーベイ：心理的安全性&lt;br/&gt;3.50（3.48）&lt;br/&gt;◆女性管理職比率　30％超（22.6％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・社員と経営層と直接対話する「車座ミーティング」の実施（62回実施、参加人数1,645人）&lt;br/&gt;・&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Beyond Awardの実施&lt;/span&gt;（社員提案制度）&lt;br/&gt;・心理的安全性の定着推進&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・女性リーダーシッププログラムの実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:57pt;min-height:57pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;多様な貢献と挑戦を促す評価・報酬&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆メンバーシップサーベイ：全員活躍状態&lt;br/&gt;60%（45％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・人事ポリシーの策定&lt;br/&gt;・人事制度・評価制度の改定検討開始&lt;br/&gt;・制度運用を含めた役職者支援 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:105.8pt;min-height:105.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;個の可能性を広げるキャリア自律&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆メンバーシップサーベイ：キャリア自律&lt;br/&gt;3.50（3.19）&lt;br/&gt;◆選択型育成プログラムの受講者数 1,000人（781人）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・「キャリア探究ノート」による上司との対話の奨励&lt;br/&gt;・キャリアエール（社内公募）の拡大（対象ポジション48件、エントリー数34人）&lt;br/&gt;・副業の解禁（62人）&lt;br/&gt;・社外留職の拡大&lt;br/&gt;・ビジネスリテラシー獲得のための育成プログラム拡大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:105.8pt;min-height:105.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;未来を創るコア人財の育成&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆重要戦略ポジション候補者の充足度&lt;br/&gt;500%（800%）&lt;br/&gt;◆グローバルでの貢献意欲のある社員率&lt;br/&gt;30%（24%）&lt;br/&gt;◆DXアカデミーのべ受講者数1,800人（1,719人）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・人財育成会議におけるサクセションプランの策定・推進&lt;br/&gt;・次世代リーダーの育成体系の構築およびプログラムの開発・実施&lt;br/&gt;・グローバルタレントマネジメントの構築&lt;br/&gt;・グローバル人財交流の促進&lt;br/&gt;・DXアカデミーの設立&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:105.8pt;min-height:105.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;健やかな心と体づくりの推進&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆平均有給休暇取得率 80％ （84.9％）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆所定外労働時間　15時間/月（17.2時間/月（※））&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;◆総合検診受診率100％（100％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;・有給休暇取得状況の月次確認と取得計画の策定&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・健康診断、人間ドックの受診勧奨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・体調不良者、休復職者の早期発見・対応と継続的な医療職による面談を実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注）選択型育成プログラム受講者数はカルビー国内グループを対象、その他指標は提出会社を対象&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　※対象は年俸者を除く社員&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetricsMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
